{"id":"zusammenarbeit","lemma":"Zusammenarbeit","pos":"noun","rank":3708,"glosses":["collaboration, cooperation, teamwork"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/De-Zusammenarbeit.ogg/De-Zusammenarbeit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Zusammenarbeit","plural":"Zusammenarbeiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin für Ihre Zusammenarbeit dankbar.","en":"I appreciate your cooperation.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"grateful, thankful"}]},{"text":"Die Zusammenarbeit mit dir macht mir wirklich Spaß.","en":"I really enjoy working with you.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"fun"}]},{"text":"Ich ertrage die Zusammenarbeit mit ihm nicht.","en":"I can't bear to work with him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to bear","l":"ertragen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen alle zusammenarbeiten.","en":"We all need to work together.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718007","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Ich würde mich über eine Zusammenarbeit mit dir freuen.","en":"I'd be happy to work with you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"dignity"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to gladden"}]}]}